  <!-- Accordion 2: The Woblee Shopping Experience -->
  <details class="footer-seo-item">
    <summary class="footer-seo-summary">
      <span class="footer-seo-summary__title">The Woblee Shopping Experience – Where Design Meets Identity</span>
      <span class="footer-seo-summary__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </summary>
    <div class="footer-seo-body">
      <div class="footer-seo-prose">
        <p>At Woblee, a t-shirt is never just a t-shirt. It starts as an idea, gets built with the discipline of a design studio, and ends up as a graphic tee that says something about the person wearing it. We are a homegrown Indian casualwear brand from Bengaluru, making premium graphic t-shirts for men, women and kids.</p>

        <p>Every piece is designed in-house and drops in limited runs, so you’re never wearing what everyone else is. From story-led graphics to embroidered artistic tees and clean everyday essentials, Woblee gives you one wardrobe for every version of you.</p>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">Shop Your Vibe, Anytime – The Online Experience</h4>
        <p>Built for how you actually shop: <a href="https://wobleedesigns.com" class="footer-seo-link">wobleedesigns.com</a> is organised around fit, story and mood, not just a product grid. Whether you’re after an oversized graphic tee for the weekend or a minimal essential for the office, you’ll find it in a few taps.</p>
        <p><strong>What you’ll find online:</strong></p>
        <ul class="footer-seo-list">
          <li><strong>Shop by Fit</strong> – Regular, Relaxed, Oversized and Boxy, each cut with its own drape and proportion.</li>
          <li><strong>Shop by Story</strong> – collections like <a href="/collections/need-a-break-1" class="footer-seo-link">Need A Break</a>, <a href="/collections/the-man-code-1" class="footer-seo-link">The Man Code</a> and <a href="/collections/digital-retro-1" class="footer-seo-link">Digital Retro</a>, each built around one idea.</li>
          <li><strong>Design Features on Every Tee</strong> – fabric, GSM, wash and print technique, listed on every product page so you know exactly what you’re buying.</li>
          <li><strong>Size Chart on Every Page</strong> – find your size before you add to cart, not after.</li>
          <li><strong>Limited-Edition Drops</strong> – new graphics arrive in small runs and don’t return once they sell out.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="footer-seo-tip">
          <strong>Style Tip:</strong> Explore the <a href="/pages/lookbook" class="footer-seo-link">Lookbook</a> to see how each collection is styled, from college days to gallery visits.
        </div>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">Craft You Can Feel – What Goes Into Every Woblee Tee</h4>
        <p>Engineered like it matters: Woblee comes from KSK, a group that earned its reputation through engineering discipline. We bring that same precision to fabric, fit and finish, led by a NIFT-trained founder and a design team with 15+ years in visuals and design.</p>
        <p><strong>What makes the difference:</strong></p>
        <ul class="footer-seo-list">
          <li><strong>100% Pure Cotton</strong> – naturally breathable for everyday wear in Indian weather.</li>
          <li><strong>Bio-Washed &amp; Enzyme-Washed</strong> – an extra-soft finish from the very first wear.</li>
          <li><strong>Premium Heavyweight GSM</strong> – 180 to 240 GSM fabrics that hold their shape and drape.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-Shrunk</strong> – made to keep its fit, wash after wash.</li>
          <li><strong>Techniques You Won’t Find Elsewhere</strong> – puff print, 3D gel print, glow-in-the-dark ink, chenille and bead embroidery, cross stitch, raw-edged appliqué and canvas patches.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="footer-seo-tip">
          <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Start with our <a href="/collections/artistic" class="footer-seo-link">Artistic Line</a> to see the craft up close. The embroidered and appliqué tees are designed to be worn like wearable art.
        </div>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">Collections With a Story – Style That Moves With You</h4>
        <p>Every collection starts with an idea: we don’t design to fill a season. Each Woblee collection is built around a feeling, a culture or a moment, then translated into graphics that carry it.</p>
        <p><strong>Discover:</strong></p>
        <ul class="footer-seo-list">
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/need-a-break-1" class="footer-seo-link">Need A Break</a></strong> – travel t-shirts, coffee and chai tees, and desi slogan graphics for the slow days and long trips.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/the-man-code-1" class="footer-seo-link">The Man Code</a></strong> – motivational t-shirts for men, built on discipline, purpose and brotherhood.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/the-firm-believer" class="footer-seo-link">The Firm Believer</a></strong> – positive quote t-shirts for anyone who backs themselves.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/alluvial-expressions" class="footer-seo-link">Alluvial Expressions</a></strong> – abstract, art-led tees that read like a canvas.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/digital-retro-1" class="footer-seo-link">Digital Retro</a></strong> – retro and vintage-inspired graphics with a modern edge.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/little-nature-explorer-1" class="footer-seo-link">Little Nature Explorer</a></strong> – nature and adventure tees for kids who never sit still.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="footer-seo-tip">
          <strong>Style Tip:</strong> Build around one statement graphic and keep everything else simple: straight denim, white sneakers and one accessory.
        </div>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">One Brand, Every You – For Men, Women and Kids</h4>
        <p>Made for every wardrobe: Woblee designs graphic t-shirts for men, t-shirts for women and t-shirts for boys and girls, all in the same quality and design language. You don’t feel the same every day, so your wardrobe shouldn’t either.</p>
        <ul class="footer-seo-list">
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/men" class="footer-seo-link">Men</a></strong> – graphic, statement, artistic and essential tees in regular to boxy fits.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/women" class="footer-seo-link">Women</a></strong> – oversized tees, embroidered tees, desi graphics and everyday essentials.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/collections/kids" class="footer-seo-link">Kids</a></strong> – soft, pre-shrunk cotton tees made to survive play, school and the washing machine.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">Why Shop at Woblee?</h4>
        <ul class="footer-seo-list">
          <li>Story-led graphics and limited-edition designs you won’t find elsewhere</li>
          <li>Premium 100% cotton in heavyweight GSM, at an accessible price</li>
          <li>Craft techniques from puff print to hand-finished embroidery</li>
          <li>Fits for every mood: Regular, Relaxed, Oversized and Boxy</li>
          <li>One brand for men, women and kids</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your wardrobe should say something. Woblee makes sure it says you.</p>

        <h4 class="footer-seo-heading">Find Your Vibe – Explore Woblee Today</h4>
        <p>Ready to wear something with a point of view? Shop the latest graphic t-shirts for men, women and kids at Woblee, from desi slogan tees and travel graphics to embroidered artistic pieces and everyday essentials. New drops land often, and they don’t stay long.</p>
        <p class="footer-seo-tagline"><strong>Be you. Be Woblee. Wear your vibe.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
